WEBVTT

00:15.265 --> 00:16.808
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

02:30.483 --> 02:31.609
Eat, Your Highness.

02:35.405 --> 02:36.906
It's not Your Highness's fault.

02:36.990 --> 02:39.868
You did your best to save those people.

02:40.577 --> 02:42.495
If I had stepped in sooner,

02:44.038 --> 02:45.498
I could have saved them.

02:45.582 --> 02:48.042
Then you would have ended up dead.

02:53.298 --> 02:54.632
You said you must stay alive.

02:55.216 --> 02:57.510
Didn't you conspire treason
in order to stay alive?

03:02.682 --> 03:04.309
I wanted to be different.

03:07.854 --> 03:10.273
I wanted to be different from those...

03:12.192 --> 03:13.443
who abandoned the weak.

03:16.905 --> 03:18.615
And you were.

03:21.326 --> 03:24.037
That is how I saw it.

03:30.835 --> 03:34.464
I will look for some herbs
to remedy the wound.

04:23.471 --> 04:24.806
Is he back?

04:28.393 --> 04:29.602
Not yet, I am afraid.

04:30.353 --> 04:31.854
His name is still unknown.

04:33.064 --> 04:36.234
His name Yeong-sin
and his identity tag are fake.

04:37.694 --> 04:41.572
At the moment, we need someone
who knows the area well.

04:42.323 --> 04:45.576
Did Your Highness
not see him wield the rifle?

04:46.786 --> 04:49.080
Not even palace guards are that skilled.

04:49.747 --> 04:52.792
Those who can match that level of prowess

04:52.875 --> 04:54.419
are the members of Chakho.

04:55.336 --> 04:58.298
Are you talking about the elite troop
that hunts tigers?

04:58.381 --> 04:59.340
Yes.

05:00.216 --> 05:02.427
Since tiger hunting is dangerous,

05:02.885 --> 05:05.763
the members are chosen
based on their fighting skills

05:05.847 --> 05:07.849
regardless of their social status.

05:08.808 --> 05:10.852
Many of them are quite dangerous.

05:10.935 --> 05:12.603
They would do anything

05:13.396 --> 05:14.939
to stay alive.

05:18.151 --> 05:21.321
They would do anything to stay alive?

05:21.404 --> 05:23.239
They are like me, then.

05:23.823 --> 05:24.699
Your Highness.

05:33.791 --> 05:34.792
Speak to me.

05:35.001 --> 05:36.753
No soldiers are on our tail.

05:37.670 --> 05:39.464
I also checked villages on the way.

05:39.547 --> 05:41.382
The disease has not spread yet,

05:41.466 --> 05:43.593
but the people are already
terrified by rumors.

05:44.177 --> 05:45.595
Judging by the empty houses,

05:45.845 --> 05:47.722
many villagers must have already fled.

07:05.007 --> 07:07.385
A monster! It's a monster!

07:26.571 --> 07:30.158
Water. Give me some water. Water!

07:32.577 --> 07:33.661
Is that...

07:33.744 --> 07:34.704
Magistrate Cho?

07:35.997 --> 07:37.457
Your Highness?

07:38.666 --> 07:40.668
Your Highness. Are you really--

07:42.086 --> 07:43.087
Your Highness, I--

07:47.175 --> 07:49.677
Do you know the blood
the people you abandoned shed?

07:50.386 --> 07:51.345
Please stop.

07:51.929 --> 07:53.306
He is not even worth killing.

08:01.022 --> 08:04.150
Did you not run for your life?
What happened to you?

08:04.734 --> 08:07.278
Well, the cargo ship...

08:07.653 --> 08:09.947
The disease spread on the ship.

08:11.991 --> 08:13.159
What do you mean?

08:16.621 --> 08:19.290
An infected corpse was on the ship.

08:19.373 --> 08:22.877
The corpse infected everyone on board.

08:22.960 --> 08:25.463
Only I was able to make it out alive.

08:25.546 --> 08:26.839
Where is the ship now?

08:28.216 --> 08:31.886
The disease started to spread
when we reached Seongju, so...

08:33.679 --> 08:35.014
If that is the case,

08:37.058 --> 08:38.351
they will reach Sangju soon.

08:39.060 --> 08:40.478
Messengers were already sent,

08:40.686 --> 08:42.396
so Sangju must be prepared for it.

08:42.480 --> 08:43.314
Actually,

08:43.981 --> 08:47.902
only city-fortresses near Dongnae
were notified of the disease.

08:50.780 --> 08:54.116
If Mungyeong Saejae in Sangju falls,

08:54.200 --> 08:56.160
the disease will reach Hanyang in no time.

09:06.504 --> 09:07.964
We leave for Sangju right away.

09:11.926 --> 09:14.971
Your Highness!

09:15.304 --> 09:18.683
Please... Let me come with you.
Your Highness!

09:55.052 --> 09:56.429
Sangju is over that mountain!

09:57.138 --> 09:58.389
Once Sangju is breached,

09:58.639 --> 10:00.766
the disease will spread
all over the nation.

10:01.225 --> 10:02.310
We must stop it.

10:04.895 --> 10:09.609
SANGJU

10:46.520 --> 10:47.688
Are the rumors true?

10:47.772 --> 10:50.066
- What?
- A cursed disease is spreading.

10:50.650 --> 10:53.319
They say a headless ghost
appears in the night.

11:09.752 --> 11:13.297
A signal fire has been sent from Dongnae.
The messenger is yet to arrive,

11:13.547 --> 11:15.883
so the local government
doesn't know the details.

11:15.966 --> 11:17.134
However,

11:18.678 --> 11:20.846
a strange rumor is spreading
across Gyeongsang.

11:21.555 --> 11:23.432
A disease is spreading in Dongnae,

11:23.516 --> 11:26.936
and its victims do not seem to stay dead.

11:46.664 --> 11:47.873
Get ready.

11:50.126 --> 11:51.585
I am leaving the mountains.

11:53.295 --> 11:54.547
This talisman

11:55.131 --> 11:58.509
will chase away all diseases and ghosts.

11:59.093 --> 12:00.886
The talisman

12:00.970 --> 12:04.724
written in cinnabar by this young shaman
is only ten bun.

12:04.807 --> 12:06.016
Only ten bun, people!

12:06.600 --> 12:09.145
- Give me one, please.
- Here, it's ten bun.

12:09.228 --> 12:11.063
Give me one too. This is all I have.

12:11.188 --> 12:13.691
How dare you try to bargain with me!

12:13.774 --> 12:15.568
You are bad luck. Shoo! Ten bun!

12:15.651 --> 12:16.944
- Bring the money.
- Damn it!

12:18.362 --> 12:19.822
- Lord Ahn Hyeon.
- Lord Ahn Hyeon!

12:19.905 --> 12:21.407
- Lord Ahn Hyeon!
- He is here!

12:41.552 --> 12:45.222
My lord, upon my inspection,
I found something peculiar by the stream.

12:45.306 --> 12:47.099
You must see it for yourself.

12:50.603 --> 12:52.688
Why is a ship that belongs to the nation

12:53.397 --> 12:55.107
stranded here at this stream?

12:55.399 --> 12:57.151
I suspect a huge commotion, my lord.

12:57.610 --> 13:00.654
It must be why a signal fire
was sent from Dongnae.

13:15.503 --> 13:18.506
There is a village deep in this forest.

13:19.173 --> 13:20.508
Yes, slash-and-burn farmers.

13:21.801 --> 13:24.762
I smell... grilled meat.

13:26.055 --> 13:27.014
I smell pork.

13:39.610 --> 13:42.488
Here and on the deck,

13:42.780 --> 13:43.948
there's blood everywhere.

14:17.731 --> 14:19.984
The floors and walls are covered in blood,

14:20.943 --> 14:24.989
so where are the injured or the dead?

14:36.500 --> 14:40.337
You never know when we will eat again,
so eat up while you can.

14:43.132 --> 14:45.342
- Eat up!
- Do not forget to chew.

14:47.011 --> 14:48.679
- Don't eat too much rice.
- It's good.

14:48.762 --> 14:49.805
Eat the pork...

14:58.689 --> 14:59.690
This is odd.

15:00.774 --> 15:03.402
People are dying of famine,
but they eat rice and pork.

15:06.822 --> 15:10.367
What brings you by deep into this forest?

15:10.951 --> 15:12.077
Where is this food from?

15:12.828 --> 15:13.996
Well,

15:15.539 --> 15:18.626
we received it as payment
for helping out at a party.

15:23.839 --> 15:25.132
No way.

15:25.257 --> 15:27.134
Move. Get out of my way!

15:30.054 --> 15:31.096
Step aside.

15:31.430 --> 15:32.598
I told you to move!

15:38.437 --> 15:40.439
I see cargo from the ship!

15:41.023 --> 15:42.942
They must have looted the ship.

15:43.275 --> 15:44.276
I apologize!

15:44.360 --> 15:47.029
Please spare my life.

15:47.112 --> 15:48.238
We are terribly sorry.

15:51.116 --> 15:53.243
It was not our intent
to steal from the ship.

15:53.327 --> 15:56.580
The food was just too good to pass up on.

15:56.664 --> 15:59.583
- Please spare our lives!
- Please spare our lives!

15:59.708 --> 16:00.793
Please forgive us.

16:01.377 --> 16:04.254
Was there anyone on the ship?

16:04.338 --> 16:07.675
Everyone was dead when we arrived.

16:07.758 --> 16:09.635
I went to check on the ship this morning.

16:09.718 --> 16:13.597
The passengers were gnawed at
as if animals had attacked them.

16:13.681 --> 16:15.057
Please believe me.

16:15.140 --> 16:17.643
What about the bodies?
Did you just leave them there?

16:17.726 --> 16:20.270
Animals would have gotten to them,

16:21.021 --> 16:22.523
so we buried them all.

16:22.606 --> 16:23.857
Where did you bury them?

16:25.943 --> 16:26.819
Where?

16:28.988 --> 16:31.740
You all committed a heinous crime.

16:31.824 --> 16:35.619
However, I understand you did so
out of hunger.

16:35.703 --> 16:39.456
If you are honest with me,
I will lessen your punishments.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.797
Let us lead the way.

16:52.553 --> 16:54.179
I found wheel marks!

17:15.409 --> 17:16.660
Are we not there yet?

17:19.288 --> 17:20.581
We are almost there.

17:35.804 --> 17:36.805
Is this the place?

17:39.975 --> 17:41.935
What are you doing? Keep leading the way!

17:52.988 --> 17:56.617
We know that those who steal
government property get beheaded.

17:57.493 --> 17:59.912
What are you talking about?

17:59.995 --> 18:02.414
We have lived long enough lives,

18:03.791 --> 18:05.793
but our children do not deserve to die.

18:06.376 --> 18:09.588
Without you to talk of our crimes,
our sins will stay hidden.

18:11.465 --> 18:13.759
You damn bastards.

18:13.842 --> 18:15.552
Do you know who you are addressing?

18:16.261 --> 18:17.262
Lower your weapons!

18:22.768 --> 18:25.062
This matter is graver than stealing.

18:25.145 --> 18:26.647
If this does not get sorted,

18:27.106 --> 18:28.565
not only you and your children

18:28.816 --> 18:32.319
but everyone in Gyeongsang might die.

18:34.404 --> 18:36.615
Now lead us to the corpses!

18:41.328 --> 18:43.163
Has hunger impaired your hearing?

18:43.664 --> 18:45.624
Where are the bodies?

18:48.961 --> 18:50.087
You're stepping on them.

19:23.328 --> 19:24.705
What is that?

20:07.873 --> 20:09.124
If you wish to live,

20:11.043 --> 20:13.170
raise your weapons and behead them all.

21:04.429 --> 21:05.764
Another wave of monsters!

21:36.211 --> 21:38.130
No. Oh, no!

21:40.549 --> 21:41.800
Help me...

21:43.343 --> 21:44.970
No!

25:09.633 --> 25:10.717
Please come down!

25:11.301 --> 25:13.345
Must I force you down here?

25:13.553 --> 25:16.097
I will be killed if I do.

25:16.181 --> 25:19.976
Everyone wants me out of the palace.

25:20.560 --> 25:23.897
If I am deposed, I will be killed.

25:25.899 --> 25:29.444
I miss my late mother.

25:31.279 --> 25:32.697
You aren't supposed to be here.

25:39.955 --> 25:41.456
This is not...

25:43.041 --> 25:44.501
where you should be.

25:49.339 --> 25:51.258
GANGNYEONGJEON

25:52.842 --> 25:54.427
I do not want to go there.

25:55.011 --> 25:57.097
Master, I would rather go back.

26:01.434 --> 26:03.395
What you said is right.

26:03.812 --> 26:05.438
His Majesty has received

26:06.189 --> 26:09.734
a stack of appeals
that claim your deposition.

26:10.860 --> 26:11.987
To make it worse,

26:12.070 --> 26:15.156
there is no one in the palace
who can protect you.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.324
So...

26:17.367 --> 26:19.077
you must protect yourself.

26:24.708 --> 26:26.126
Your Highness...

26:27.502 --> 26:30.171
is not just trying
to protect your own life.

26:31.131 --> 26:33.049
You are in a battle against injustice.

26:33.133 --> 26:35.343
There are those who are trying to make

26:35.427 --> 26:38.555
the Crown Prince their puppets
for their own interest.

26:38.638 --> 26:41.141
Fighting and winning against that evil

26:41.224 --> 26:43.560
is the only way to uphold justice.

27:06.291 --> 27:07.667
Show your respects!

27:08.168 --> 27:09.878
He is the Crown Prince,

27:10.587 --> 27:12.047
the heir to the throne!

27:14.883 --> 27:17.719
- We greet His Highness!
- We greet His Highness!

27:26.436 --> 27:27.812
It has been a while,

27:29.189 --> 27:30.190
Master.

27:41.576 --> 27:43.578
There is no lie to any of it.

27:43.953 --> 27:44.996
Father...

27:48.249 --> 27:49.584
has passed away.

27:50.168 --> 27:52.879
Lord Cho, obsessed with power,
had Physician Lee Seung-hui

27:53.004 --> 27:55.799
feed my father the resurrection plant
that turned him into...

27:57.634 --> 27:58.760
a flesh-craving monster.

27:59.344 --> 28:01.471
That is what started
the horrific epidemic.

28:04.307 --> 28:06.976
Cho Hak-ju is as atrocious as ever.
You must help.

28:08.103 --> 28:10.605
I will return to Hanyang,
punish the Haewon Cho Clan,

28:11.731 --> 28:13.608
and build this nation anew.

28:20.740 --> 28:21.950
When was the last time...

28:23.493 --> 28:25.370
you had some sleep?

28:26.996 --> 28:28.415
What do you mean?

28:29.833 --> 28:32.252
Have you come all this way

28:33.545 --> 28:35.588
despite the hunger
and disheveled appearance?

28:38.508 --> 28:40.844
Thugs on the street can do so.

28:41.386 --> 28:42.303
However...

28:44.347 --> 28:45.640
Your Highness may not.

28:47.350 --> 28:48.560
The Crown Prince

28:49.227 --> 28:50.395
must always...

28:51.312 --> 28:54.858
look decent and confident.

29:03.116 --> 29:07.746
Sangju is my hometown
and where I currently reside.

29:08.788 --> 29:10.039
I urge you, Your Highness,

29:10.999 --> 29:12.584
to rest peacefully for tonight.

29:15.420 --> 29:17.130
- Hurry.
- Yes, sir.

29:35.231 --> 29:38.985
What kind of a man is Lord Ahn Hyeon?

29:42.030 --> 29:43.281
Why are you asking me that?

29:43.865 --> 29:45.700
Don't you find it odd?

29:47.327 --> 29:49.746
Neither Lord Ahn nor his servants

29:49.829 --> 29:52.081
were alarmed at the sight of the ill.

29:52.165 --> 29:55.835
They swiftly beheaded
and burned the infected.

29:55.919 --> 29:58.296
They didn't hesitate
in fighting the infected.

29:58.379 --> 30:02.675
It's as if they knew well
about the infected.

30:10.099 --> 30:11.643
Escort His Highness.

30:11.726 --> 30:14.604
Also, find his companions a place to rest.

30:15.438 --> 30:16.731
This way, Your Highness.

30:41.506 --> 30:43.299
What did Lord Ahn say?

30:44.133 --> 30:46.803
He did not give me a definite answer.

30:50.098 --> 30:52.183
Can he truly be trusted?

30:54.519 --> 30:55.478
Your Highness.

30:56.646 --> 30:58.439
He may still be mourning,

30:58.606 --> 31:00.692
but even when Lord Cho
suppressed the scholars,

31:00.775 --> 31:03.403
Lord Ahn did not even lift a finger
to help them.

31:04.779 --> 31:07.615
He could be in alliance with Lord Cho.

31:07.699 --> 31:08.992
Watch what you say.

31:10.326 --> 31:12.161
He is not one you speak lightly of.

31:13.997 --> 31:15.081
But Your Highness--

31:15.164 --> 31:16.457
Get some rest too.

31:17.292 --> 31:19.502
You have not been able to
these past few days.

31:27.343 --> 31:29.053
PATIENT JOURNAL

31:34.726 --> 31:38.021
HANYANG

31:44.068 --> 31:44.903
Look here.

31:44.986 --> 31:48.031
Why does he get food and not me? Why?

31:48.323 --> 31:49.824
Seriously?

32:05.173 --> 32:06.758
What is wrong?

32:08.259 --> 32:09.218
My gosh.

32:12.388 --> 32:13.806
Over here!

32:14.223 --> 32:15.892
Look...

33:29.716 --> 33:32.969
Feeding the flesh of the infected
to a healthy subject

33:33.636 --> 33:37.724
leads to the transmission of the disease.

33:39.100 --> 33:40.935
This cannot be controlled.

33:43.312 --> 33:45.148
Before it reaches the northern region,

33:46.274 --> 33:47.692
the epidemic must be contained.

34:23.019 --> 34:26.105
MONUMENT TO THE BATTLE OF UNPO WETLAND

34:29.650 --> 34:32.278
TO COMMEMORATE THE VICTORY
OF GOVERNOR AHN HYEON OF GYEONGSANG,

34:32.361 --> 34:34.489
WHO DEFEATED 30,000 JAPANESE SOLDIERS
WITH 500 SOLDIERS

34:47.585 --> 34:51.714
SUMANG VILLAGE

34:58.805 --> 35:00.014
Do not go.

35:16.614 --> 35:18.866
Please do not leave me.

35:19.200 --> 35:20.535
Can you please stay?

35:20.618 --> 35:23.079
Go back inside. I promise I will be back.

35:30.044 --> 35:31.921
Please! Do not go!

35:37.009 --> 35:39.637
You must come back.

35:40.054 --> 35:41.305
You must!

36:35.693 --> 36:37.695
NORTH GATE OF SANGJU

36:37.778 --> 36:39.906
Here comes a messenger!

36:49.415 --> 36:51.375
How did it go? Did you find it?

36:51.667 --> 36:53.836
- Is this it, my lord?
- Yes, it's.

36:56.297 --> 36:57.590
Good job.

37:05.264 --> 37:08.809
Is that the cargo from the ship?

37:08.893 --> 37:10.019
Yes, my lord.

37:10.436 --> 37:12.313
Nothing disastrous happened

37:12.396 --> 37:15.191
thanks to Lord Ahn
locating the infected heading north,

37:15.858 --> 37:18.486
but he mentioned
to heighten security down south.

37:18.569 --> 37:19.403
Anyway,

37:19.987 --> 37:22.823
- is it true?
- May I ask what you are referring to?

37:25.493 --> 37:29.121
I heard that His Highness
is here in Sangju.

37:29.205 --> 37:30.748
Is it true?

37:33.042 --> 37:34.126
My lord!

37:36.796 --> 37:38.756
The Five Armies has left Hanyang

37:38.839 --> 37:40.424
and is headed for Mungyeong Saejae.

38:12.164 --> 38:12.999
Hey, Seo-bi!

38:13.582 --> 38:14.542
Seo-bi!

38:24.343 --> 38:27.054
Where have you been all alone?
I looked for you everywhere.

38:27.138 --> 38:29.473
I was looking for medicinal herbs
for His Highness.

38:29.557 --> 38:30.975
Forget about the herbs.

38:32.059 --> 38:32.893
Run away with me.

38:32.977 --> 38:34.812
You will die if you return to his side.

38:34.895 --> 38:37.398
- Follow me.
- What are you talking about?

38:38.399 --> 38:41.193
The Five Armies is coming
to arrest His Highness.

38:41.277 --> 38:42.445
What?

38:43.321 --> 38:44.530
Is that true?

38:44.613 --> 38:48.117
Being with a man who committed treason
will ensure your death.

38:49.285 --> 38:51.620
I am of the Haewon Cho Clan,

38:51.912 --> 38:54.165
so I will be able to protect you. Come on!

38:56.709 --> 38:58.002
Are you running away again?

38:58.085 --> 38:59.378
No, well--

38:59.462 --> 39:02.048
His Highness went through hoops

39:02.131 --> 39:04.425
to save the people you abandoned,

39:04.717 --> 39:07.011
but here you are
turning your back on him again.

39:07.595 --> 39:11.349
Is it really hard for you to show bravery
for once in your life?

39:11.932 --> 39:13.434
Well, you see--

39:13.601 --> 39:15.061
Run away on your own.

39:15.895 --> 39:17.313
I will stay with His Highness.

39:17.396 --> 39:18.898
But, wait...

39:20.566 --> 39:21.442
Seo-bi!

39:22.651 --> 39:24.153
Seo-bi!

39:24.653 --> 39:25.946
Seo-bi!

39:36.665 --> 39:39.001
Slow down or you will choke.

39:39.210 --> 39:43.005
You do not have to get greedy.
There is more, so eat up.

39:43.089 --> 39:46.008
My goodness, you look so young
to be pregnant.

39:48.010 --> 39:49.136
Here, let me take it.

39:49.220 --> 39:53.391
Thank you for taking care
of lowly peasants like us.

39:53.474 --> 39:55.017
There is no need to thank me.

39:55.101 --> 39:57.728
Stop talking nonsense and just eat up.

39:57.812 --> 39:58.979
- Sure!
- Thank you.

39:59.063 --> 40:01.023
Eat up and give birth to sons!

40:01.107 --> 40:03.150
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

40:07.279 --> 40:08.906
By the way, who could it be?

40:08.989 --> 40:11.075
Who is taking such good care of us?

40:11.158 --> 40:12.785
How should we know? Just eat up.

40:13.953 --> 40:15.830
- No one is telling us.
- Well,

40:15.913 --> 40:19.041
I am grateful for the food
and the shelter,

40:19.125 --> 40:20.876
but I still find it odd.

40:21.627 --> 40:24.588
Why have they only gathered
pregnant women who have nowhere to go?

40:24.672 --> 40:27.466
Eat up while it's all for free.

40:27.550 --> 40:29.718
It looks like you will give birth
any time soon.

40:30.928 --> 40:33.681
Eat up and just pop out a healthy baby.

40:34.140 --> 40:35.266
Thank you.

40:37.393 --> 40:39.895
My lady. Yes, you.

40:41.272 --> 40:43.065
How did you end up here?

40:43.149 --> 40:44.817
You do not seem like one of us.

40:46.026 --> 40:48.571
My husband told me to be here.

40:51.031 --> 40:52.408
What do you mean by that?

40:52.950 --> 40:55.494
Does your husband know the master
of this household?

40:56.370 --> 40:58.747
My husband is the Crown Prince's guard,

40:58.831 --> 41:00.624
and he went on a trip
with His Highness.

41:00.708 --> 41:04.253
He was worried to leave me alone,
so he told me to come here.

41:04.336 --> 41:06.005
No wonder.

41:06.088 --> 41:08.632
I knew you were not
a pathetic widow like us.

41:08.716 --> 41:10.885
How sweet.

41:10.968 --> 41:13.345
You have a wonderful husband.

41:13.429 --> 41:15.514
Anyway, please eat up.

41:15.890 --> 41:17.141
- Please enjoy.
- Sure.

41:58.807 --> 42:01.810
Your Majesty, it's time for the assembly.

42:03.896 --> 42:04.897
I shall go.

43:04.873 --> 43:07.876
The Queen shall now enter!

43:52.004 --> 43:55.215
- We greet Her Majesty.
- We greet Her Majesty.

44:17.905 --> 44:19.156
The Court will hear

44:20.240 --> 44:22.618
Her Majesty's royal edict.

44:26.789 --> 44:29.291
"Heaven gave no blessing to this nation

44:30.042 --> 44:33.504
which led to His Majesty
suddenly falling ill

44:33.587 --> 44:35.214
and losing consciousness.

44:36.173 --> 44:38.175
Meanwhile, his son, the Crown Prince,

44:38.759 --> 44:40.594
committed high treason

44:41.136 --> 44:44.640
by desiring the throne for himself.

44:44.723 --> 44:47.101
Such commotion
has disrupted the royal family,

44:47.184 --> 44:49.144
and the throne is left empty.

44:49.228 --> 44:51.647
Now, an awful disease
is spreading through the nation,

44:52.314 --> 44:54.316
bringing nothing but suffering
to the people.

44:54.817 --> 44:56.860
How is this not a tragedy?

44:57.820 --> 45:00.989
I no longer can reject the sincere

45:01.073 --> 45:04.034
and loyal advice
of current and retired officials

45:04.118 --> 45:06.328
regarding the throne staying vacant,

45:06.412 --> 45:10.416
which is why I will brace myself
and take over as Queen Regent."

45:10.499 --> 45:14.169
- Thank you for your generosity!
- Thank you for your generosity!

45:14.753 --> 45:16.797
On her first day as Queen Regent,

45:17.381 --> 45:20.134
Her Majesty will relay her first orders.

45:20.926 --> 45:24.638
"To eradicate the disease
terrorizing the land of Gyeongsang,

45:24.805 --> 45:26.765
the Five Armies consisting of

45:26.849 --> 45:29.560
the Military Training Command,
the Royal Commander Division,

45:29.643 --> 45:32.062
and the Southern Fort Command
will be sent to help."

45:36.567 --> 45:38.944
The drum indicates
that they passed the second gate.

45:39.027 --> 45:40.904
They will be here soon.

45:44.158 --> 45:45.617
I see them coming!

46:07.514 --> 46:08.974
THE FIRST GATE OF YEONGNAM

46:22.571 --> 46:24.156
What is that?

46:27.826 --> 46:29.161
"From this moment on,

46:29.828 --> 46:33.081
western and eastern part of Gyeongsang
will be sealed off."

46:34.625 --> 46:36.627
Seal off the first gate!

46:36.710 --> 46:38.253
What is going on?

46:41.715 --> 46:43.383
What are you doing?

46:43.634 --> 46:45.010
Why are you sealing off--

46:48.430 --> 46:51.058
What are you doing?

46:52.684 --> 46:54.269
Stop!

47:12.079 --> 47:15.999
SANGJU

47:26.301 --> 47:30.389
"Mungyeong Saejae, the main road
that leads out of Gyeongsang

47:30.472 --> 47:33.433
as well as the gates of Jungnyeong,
Chupungnyeong and Gyeripnyeong

47:33.517 --> 47:35.018
will be sealed off.

47:35.602 --> 47:39.022
Anyone who acts against this order
will be executed on the spot,

47:39.523 --> 47:41.525
demonstrating the seriousness of the law."

47:41.608 --> 47:45.571
- Thank you for your boundless generosity!
- Thank you for your boundless generosity!

51:52.651 --> 51:54.653
Subtitle translation by Hye-lim Park
